	(text "MODE HIGH: SPI PROGRAMMING.\nONE DATA LANE ON DOUT0; DOUT2, DOUT3, DIN0, DIN1\nBECOME INPUTS AND ARE TIED TO DGND.\nCODE ON GPIO0, GPIO1, GPIO4: DISABLED AT\nPOWER-UP, SO THE CHANNEL STARTS OFF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
